// Knocked-down fighters fall at the right speed.
// Halves the gravity constant (one reader) and the vertical step in FUN_001DED28; terminal velocity
// stays in 30Hz units.
[60FPS - gravity]
description=Halve the gravity acceleration and the vertical step it drives, so a knocked-down fighter falls at its real-time speed (FUN_001DED28).
