// Cut-in mouth and face tracks no longer stop mid-sentence.
// Halves the keyframe clock add at 0024ED20 and 0024F290 (rate 2.0). Hooks the add, not the rate
// load; the trampolines replay what the delay slot got wrong.
[60FPS - mouth clock]
description=Halve the cut-in keyframe clock, so scripted mouth and face tracks play at their real speed.
